msgstr "WaterMark PDF  Options"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:137
msgid ""
"<strong>Note:</strong> This free watermarking plugin is rudimentary and may "
"not work on every PDF. Test before going live!"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Note :</strong> Ce plugin de filigrane gratuit est rudimentaire et "
"peut ne pas fonctionner sur tous les PDF. Testez-le avant de le mettre en "
"ligne !"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:138
msgid ""
"<p><a href=\"https://web.little-package.com/downloads/waterwoo-pdf-premium/"
"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Purchase the premium version of "
"Watermark PDF for WooCommerce</a> if you want: page and position control, "
"extended <strong>shortcodes</strong>, including order number, quantity sold "
"and future dates;<br />"
msgstr ""
"<p><a href=\"https://web.little-package.com/downloads/waterwoo-pdf-premium/"
"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Achetez la version premium de "
"Watermark PDF for WooCommerce</a> si vous voulez : contrôle de la page et de "
"la position, <strong>shortcodes</strong> étendus, y compris le numéro de "
"commande, la quantité vendue et les dates futures<br />"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:139
msgid ""
"<strong>opacity</strong> control; custom <strong>fonts</strong>, extended "
"characters & RTL; <strong>barcodes</strong> and QR codes; <strong>password</"
"strong> protection & permissions control;<br />"
msgstr ""
"contrôle <strong>de l'opacité;</strong> <strong>polices personnalisées, "
"caractères étendus</strong>- RTL; <strong>codes à barres</strong> et codes "
"QR; protection <strong>par mot de passe</strong> et contrôle des "
"autorisations;<br>"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:140
msgid ""
"backend <strong>test watermarking</strong> of PDFs on-the-fly; <strong>per-"
"product</strong> and variable product watermarking; <strong>Dropbox & S3</"
"strong> support; compatibility with <strong>Free Downloads WooCommerce</"
"strong>; AND MORE!</p>"
msgstr ""
"marquage à <strong>l'essai</strong> de backend des FDP à la volée; "
"<strong>par produit</strong> et marque à filigrane variable; <strong>Soutien "
"Dropbox et S3;</strong> compatibilité avec <strong>Free Downloads "
"WooCommerce;</strong> ET PLUS ENCORE!<p>"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:146
msgid "Enable Watermarking"
msgstr "Activez le tatouage"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:147
msgid "Check to enable PDF watermarking"
msgstr "Cocher pour activer le filigranage PDF"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:154
msgid "File(s) to watermark"
msgstr "Fichier (s) à filigrane"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:155
msgid ""
"List file name(s) of PDF(s) to watermark, one per line, e.g., <code>upload."
"pdf</code> or <code>my_pdf.pdf</code> .<br />If left blank, Watermark PDF "
"for WooCommerce will watermark all PDFs sold through WooCommerce."
msgstr ""
"Liste des noms des fichiers de PDF(s) de filigrane, un par ligne, par "
"exemple, <code>upload.pdf</code> ou <code>my_pdf.pdf</code> .<br>Si laissé "
"vide, Watermark PDF for WooCommerce sera filigrane tous les PDFs vendus par "
"l'intermédiaire de WooCommerce."

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:163
msgid "Custom text for footer watermark"
msgstr "Texte personnalisé pour le filigrane de pied de page"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:164
msgid ""
"Shortcodes available, all caps, in brackets: <code>[FIRSTNAME]</code> "
"<code>[LASTNAME]</code> <code>[EMAIL]</code> <code>[PHONE]</code> "
"<code>[DATE]</code>"
msgstr ""
"Shortcodes disponibles, tout en majuscules, entre parenthèses : "
"<code>[FIRSTNAME]</code> <code>[LASTNAME]</code> <code>[EMAIL]</code> "
"<code>[PHONE]</code><code>[DATE]</code>"

#: classes/wwpdf-settings.php:165
msgid "Licensed to [FIRSTNAME] [LASTNAME], [EMAIL]"
msgstr "Licence à [FIRSTNAME] [LASTNAME], [EMAIL]"

